        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Harvey Pekar, Denise Levertov, Joyce Brabner\n- Roles: comic book writer, music critic, media personality, poet, political comics writer\n- Works: American Splendor\n\nFacts:\n- Denise Levertov, born Priscilla Denise Levertov on October 24, 1923, was an American poet.\n- Harvey Pekar, born Harvey Lawrence Pekar on October 8, 1939, was an American underground comic book writer, music critic, and media personality.\n- Joyce Brabner, born on March 1, 1952, is a writer of political comics.\n- Harvey Pekar was best known for his autobiographical comic series American Splendor.\n- Denise Levertov died on December 20, 1997.\n- Harvey Pekar died on July 12, 2010.\n- Joyce Brabner is the widow of Harvey Pekar.",
